  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Fostering accountability and efficiency in public service delivery in Puebla</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This IDF grant aims at providing different instruments and methodologies to the State of Puebla to increase transparency, accountability and efficiency in public service delivery through a greater participation of civil society in select vulnerable areas. The objectives of the grant the IDF grant will be attained by: i) creating institutional mechanisms through which civil society can be actively involved in policy making and anti-corruption strategies to improve service delivery; ii) strengthening transparency and accountability of state-run institutions in key services that are vulnerable to corrupt practices by taking into account the voice of citizens; and iii) building the capacity of public servants to avoid corrupt practices and increasing efficiency and consumer-friendliness in the delivery of key public services.</narrative>
  </description>
